FnChck3D()
Prgm

© Check available
© Entries in graph mode
© Returns list → fnlst
©
© ( Graph Mode 3D Only )

ClrErr

DelVar fnlst

Local a,eq,var,eqs
Local eqsv,smea,smb

setMode("Exact/Approx","AUTO")→smea
setMode("Base","DEC")→smb

0→a
0→eqsv
{}→fnlst
""→eq
""→eqs
""→var
"z"→eq
"(x,y)"→var

For a,1,99,1
 eq&string(a)&var→eqs
 expr(eqs)→eqsv
 If string(eqsv)≠eqs Then
  1→fnlst[a]
 Else
  0→fnlst[a]
 EndIf
EndFor

setMode("Exact/Approx",smea)
setMode("Base",smb)

EndPrgm
